cription":"ä¿®ç‹—æ¯æ¬¡ä»˜è¿‡è·¯è´¹æ—¶ï¼Œå¯é€‰æ‹©æ”¯ä»˜åŒå€è´¹ç”¨ä½¿å¯¹æ–¹åœ°äº§é™ä¸€çº§ã€‚ç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹æ—¶è·å¾—å»ºç­‘æ´¥è´´ï¼šåŸºç¡€2000å…ƒ + æ¯æ ‹åœ°äº§200å…ƒ","color":"#865b52","imageId":"image-sxlfh0","initCode":"((player: IPlayer, gameProcess: IGameProcess) => {\n  player.buffManager.addBuff({\n    id: `demolition-skill-` + player.id,\n    name: `æ‹†è¿`,\n    triggerTiming: `ä»˜è¿‡è·¯è´¹æ—¶`,\n    description: `å¯é€‰æ‹©æ”¯ä»˜åŒå€è¿‡è·¯è´¹ä½¿å¯¹æ–¹åœ°äº§é™ä¸€çº§`,\n    source: `è§’è‰²æŠ€èƒ½`\n  });\n  gameProcess.properties.forEach((property, propKey) => {\n    property.modifierManager.add($mod__demolition, { contextData: { playerId: player.id } });\n  });\n});"},{"id":"role-updhap","name":"çè™¾","description":"å¯¹ï¼Œè¿™æ˜¯ä¸€åªè™¾ã€‚ä»–ä¼šå¾€åæ–¹å‘èµ°ï¼ˆç¬¬ä¸€åœˆä¸é¢†å·¥èµ„ï¼‰ã€‚ä¹‹åæ¯åœˆé€’å¢è¡¥å¿ï¼šç¬¬äºŒåœˆ2500å…ƒï¼Œç¬¬ä¸‰åœˆèµ·3000å…ƒ","color":"#E74C3C","imageId":"image-qg9xxg","initCode":"((player: IPlayer, gameProcess: IGameProcess) => {\n    if (!gameProcess.reverseWalkers) {\n        gameProcess.reverseWalkers = {};\n    }\n    gameProcess.reverseWalkers[player.id] = { hasCompletedFirstLap: false };\n    player.modifierManager.add($mod__reverse_walker);\n})"},{"id":"role-yce1tw","name":"æ²³è±š","description":"æ²³è±šï¼Œæ¯è¢«æ”¶äº†3æ¬¡è¿‡è·¯è´¹ä¹‹åä¼šå“ˆæ°”ï¼Œå…é™¤ä¸‹ä¸€æ¬¡è¿‡è·¯è´¹ã€‚ç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹è·å¾—2000å…ƒå¥–é‡‘ï¼Œè“„æ°”è¿›åº¦+1ï¼ˆæ¯3æ¬¡è“„æ°”å…å•ä¸€æ¬¡è¿‡è·¯è´¹ï¼‰","color":"#1ABC9C","imageId":"image-98npoc","initCode":"((player: IPlayer, gameProcess: IGameProcess) => {\n    player.pufferTollCount = 0;\n    player.buffManager.addBuff({\n        id: `puffer-toll-display-` + player.id,\n        name: `è“„æ°”`,\n        triggerTiming: `è¢«æ”¶è¿‡è·¯è´¹æ—¶`,\n        description: `æ¯ä»˜3æ¬¡è¿‡è·¯è´¹å“ˆæ°”å…å• Â· è¿›åº¦ 0/3`,\n        source: `è§’è‰²æŠ€èƒ½`\n    });\n    player.buffManager.addBuff({\n        id: `puffer-no-start-bonus-` + player.id,\n        name: `æ²³è±šæœ¬æ€§`,\n        triggerTiming: `è¢«åŠ¨æ•ˆæœ`,\n        description: `ç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹ä¸è·å¾—å¥–é‡‘`,\n        source: `è§’è‰²æŠ€èƒ½`\n    });\n    gameProcess.properties.forEach((property, propKey) => {\n        property.modifierManager.add($mod__puffer_toll, { contextData: { ownerPlayerId: player.id } });\n    });\n})"}],"inUse":false,"mapEvents":[{"id":"event-6n1nty","name":"è¯åˆ¸ä¸­å¿ƒ","description":"","type":"PassedEvent","iconId":"image-ecemlp","properties":[],"effectCode":"(async (player: IPlayer, gameProcess: IGameProcess) => {\n  gameProcess.setCurrentEventName(`${player.name} æ“ä½œè‚¡ç¥¨`);\n\n  enum StockMode {\n    Buy = \"BUY\",\n    Sell = \"SELL\",\n  }\n\n  const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n  const isAIPlayer = Boolean((player as IPlayer & { isAI?: boolean }).isAI);\n\n  while (true) {\n    const playerMoney = Number(player.money) || 0;\n    const playerHoldings = stockMarket.getPlayerHoldingStock(player.id).filter((record) => record.holding > 0);\n    const buyableStocks = stockMarket.data.stocks.filter((stock) => {\n      const maxBuyAmount = Math.floor(playerMoney / (stock.price * (1 + stockMarket.getTaxRate(true))));\n      return maxBuyAmount > 0;\n    });\n\n    const stockModeItems = [\n      ...((!isAIPlayer || buyableStocks.length > 0) ? [{ id: StockMode.Buy, display: \"è´­ä¹°è‚¡ç¥¨\" }] : []),\n      ...((!isAIPlayer || playerHoldings.length > 0) ? [{ id: StockMode.Sell, display: \"å–å‡ºè‚¡ç¥¨\" }] : []),\n    ];\n\n    if (stockModeItems.length === 0) {\n      break;\n    }\n\n    const stockModeRes = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\n      title: \"è‚¡ç¥¨äº¤æ˜“ç»ˆç«¯\",\n      content: \"æ¬¢è¿æ¥åˆ°äº¤æ˜“ä¸­å¿ƒï¼Œé€‰æ‹©åŠç†çš„ä¸šåŠ¡\",\n      closable: true,\n      cancelText: \"é€€å‡º\",\n      column: 2,\n      itemList: stockModeItems,\n    });\n\n    if (stockModeRes.selected.length === 0) {\n      break;\n    }\n    const stockMode = stockModeRes.selected[0] as StockMode;\n\n    const isBuy = stockMode === StockMode.Buy;\n    const config = {\n      title: isBuy ? \"ä¹°å…¥è‚¡ç¥¨\" : \"å–å‡ºè‚¡ç¥¨\",\n      actionName: isBuy ? \"ä¹°å…¥\" : \"å–å‡º\",\n      cancelText: \"è¿”å›\",\n    };\n\n    if (!isBuy && playerHoldings.length === 0) {\n      gameProcess.messageNotify([player.id], { type: \"error\", content: \"ä½ æ²¡æœ‰è‚¡ç¥¨å¯ä»¥å‡ºå”®\" });\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const candidateStocks = isBuy ? (isAIPlayer ? buyableStocks : stockMarket.data.stocks) : playerHoldings.map((record) => record.stock);\n    if (candidateStocks.length === 0) {\n      if (isBuy) {\n        gameProcess.messageNotify([player.id], { type: \"warning\", content: \"å½“å‰æ²¡æœ‰å¯ä¹°å…¥çš„è‚¡ç¥¨\" });\n      }\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const chooseStockRes = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\n      title: config.title,\n      content: `è¯·é€‰æ‹©è¦${config.actionName}çš„è‚¡ç¥¨`,\n      cancelText: config.cancelText,\n      itemList: candidateStocks.map(turnStockToSelectorItem),\n    }, { timeout: 30000 });\n\n    if (chooseStockRes.selected.length === 0) {\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const choosedStock = stockMarket.getStock(chooseStockRes.selected[0]);\n    if (!choosedStock) {\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const numLimit = isBuy\n      ? Math.floor(playerMoney / (choosedStock.price * (1 + stockMarket.getTaxRate(true))))\n      : stockMarket.getHolding(player.id, choosedStock.id);\n\n    if (numLimit <= 0) {\n      gameProcess.messageNotify([player.id], {\n        type: \"warning\",\n        content: isBuy ? \"ä½ çš„èµ„é‡‘ä¸è¶³ä»¥ä¹°å…¥è¿™åªè‚¡ç¥¨\" : \"ä½ æ²¡æœ‰è¶³å¤Ÿçš„æŒä»“å¯ä»¥å–å‡º\",\n      });\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const stockNumRes = await gameProcess.showFormDialog(player.id, {\n      title: `${config.actionName} ${choosedStock.name}`,\n      content: {\n        id: \"stock-trade-info\",\n        type: \"div\",\n        variable: {\n          actionName: config.actionName,\n          stockPrice: choosedStock.price,\n          taxRate: stockMarket.getTaxRate(isBuy) * 100,\n          numLimit,\n        },\n        children: [$ui__stock_trade_info],\n      },\n      cancelText: \"æ”¾å¼ƒ\",\n      fields: [{\n        key: \"stockNum\",\n        label: \"äº¤æ˜“è‚¡æ•°\",\n        defaultValue: 0,\n        min: 0,\n        max: numLimit,\n      }],\n    }, { timeout: 30000 });\n\n    if (!stockNumRes.submitted) {\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const stockNum = Number(stockNumRes[\"stockNum\"] ?? 0);\n    if (!Number.isFinite(stockNum) || stockNum <= 0) {\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const canTradeRes = stockMarket.canTrade(player.id, choosedStock.id, stockNum, isBuy);\n    if (!canTradeRes.ok) {\n      gameProcess.messageNotify([player.id], { type: \"error\", content: canTradeRes.msg || \"äº¤æ˜“å¤±è´¥\" });\n      if (isAIPlayer) {\n        break;\n      }\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    if (isBuy) {\n      const receipt = stockMarket.commitBuy(player.id, choosedStock.id, stockNum);\n      if (!receipt) {\n        if (isAIPlayer) {\n          break;\n        }\n        continue;\n      }\n      await player.cost(receipt.totalCost);\n      gameProcess.messageNotify([player.id], { type: \"success\", content: `æˆåŠŸä¹°å…¥ ${choosedStock.name} x${stockNum}è‚¡ï¼Œæ”¯å‡º ${receipt.totalCost} ï¿¥` });\n      gameProcess.messageNotify([...gameProcess.players.keys()].filter((pId) => pId !== player.id), { type: \"success\", content: `${player.name} æˆåŠŸä¹°å…¥ ${choosedStock.name} x${stockNum}è‚¡ï¼Œæ”¯å‡º ${receipt.totalCost} ï¿¥` });\n    } else {\n      const receipt = stockMarket.commitSell(player.id, choosedStock.id, stockNum);\n      if (!receipt) {\n        if (isAIPlayer) {\n          break;\n        }\n        continue;\n      }\n      await player.gain(receipt.totalCost, 'stock_sell');\n      gameProcess.messageNotify([player.id], { type: \"success\", content: `æˆåŠŸå–å‡º ${choosedStock.name} x${stockNum}è‚¡ï¼Œè·å¾— ${receipt.totalCost} ï¿¥` });\n      gameProcess.messageNotify([...gameProcess.players.keys()].filter((pId) => pId !== player.id), { type: \"success\", content: `${player.name} æˆåŠŸå–å‡º ${choosedStock.name} x${stockNum}è‚¡ï¼Œè·å¾— ${receipt.totalCost} ï¿¥` });\n    }\n    gameProcess.gameDataBroadcast();\n\n    if (isAIPlayer) {\n      break;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function turnStockToSelectorItem(stock: Stock): SelectorItem {\n    return {\n      id: stock.id,\n      display: {\n        id: \"stock-display\",\n        type: \"div\",\n        variable: {\n          stockName: stock.name,\n          stockColor: stock.color,\n          areaColor: stock.display.color,\n          areaPath: stock.display.areaPath,\n          linePath: stock.display.linePath,\n          price: stock.display.price,\n          percent: stock.display.percent,\n        },\n        children: [$ui__stock_preview],\n      },\n    };\n  }\n});"},{"id":"event-ctx7rf","name":"èµ·ç‚¹","description":"ç©å®¶ç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹æ—¶æ ¹æ®è§’è‰²æœºåˆ¶è·å¾—å¥–é‡‘ï¼Œé‡‘é¢éšé€šèƒ€å€ç‡è°ƒæ•´","type":"PassedEvent","iconId":"image-fc9a81","properties":[],"tempFilePath":"C:\\DEV\\code\\epiboly\\sjz-monopoly\\resource\\èµ·ç‚¹.png","effectCode":"(async (player: IPlayer, gameProcess: IGameProcess) => {\n  const roleId = player.getUser().roleId;\n\n  // ===== é“¶è¡Œè´·æ¬¾ï¼šç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹ä»…æŒ‚è´¦ï¼Œç¦»å¼€èµ·ç‚¹åçš„å›åˆç»“æŸç‚¹ç”±è¿˜æ¬¾ä¿®é¥°å™¨è‡ªåŠ¨æ‰£æ¬¾ =====\n  const loanDebts = gameProcess.bankloanDebts || {};\n  const loan = loanDebts[player.id];\n  if (loan && loan.left > 0 && !loan.due) {\n    loan.due = true;\n    gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast('info', player.name + ' æœ¬æœŸé“¶è¡Œè´·æ¬¾ ï¿¥' + loan.per + ' å·²æŒ‚è´¦ï¼Œç¦»å¼€èµ·ç‚¹åè‡ªåŠ¨æ‰£æ¬¾');\n    gameProcess.gameDataBroadcast();\n  }\n\n  // ===== é€†è¡Œè€…ï¼ˆçè™¾ï¼‰ï¼šç¬¬ä¸€åœˆä¸é¢†å·¥èµ„ =====\n  const rw = gameProcess.reverseWalkers?.[player.id];\n  if (rw && !rw.hasCompletedFirstLap) {\n    rw.hasCompletedFirstLap = true;\n    gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast('warning', `${player.name} æ˜¯é€†è¡Œè€…ï¼Œç¬¬ä¸€åœˆä¸é¢†å·¥èµ„ï¼`);\n    return;\n  }\n\n  // ===== æ ¹æ®è§’è‰²è®¡ç®—å¥–é‡‘ =====\n  let bonus = 2000;  // é»˜è®¤åŸºç¡€å¥–é‡‘\n  let message = `${player.name} ç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹ï¼Œè·å¾— ${bonus} å…ƒ`;\n\n  // ä½¿ç”¨ switch-case ä¼˜åŒ–ä»£ç ç»“æ„\n  switch (roleId) {\n    // 1. é­”æ³•çŒ«å’ªï¼šå‘½è¿éª°å­ï¼ˆç‹¬ç«‹æŠ•æ·ï¼‰\n    case 'role-6g9vqu': {\n      const fateResults = await player.rollDices();\n      const fateRoll = fateResults.reduce((sum, d) => sum + d.result, 0);\n      if (fateRoll <= 4) {\n        bonus = 500;\n      } else if (fateRoll <= 10) {\n        bonus = 1500;\n      } else {\n        bonus = 3000;\n      }\n      message = `${player.name} çš„é­”æ³•çŒ«å’ªæ·å‡º ${fateRoll} ç‚¹ï¼Œè·å¾— ${bonus} å…ƒï¼`;\n      break;\n    }\n\n    // 2. çè™¾ï¼šç¬¬äºŒåœˆèµ·2500ï¼Œç¬¬ä¸‰åœˆèµ·3000\n    case 'role-updhap': {\n      if (rw?.hasCompletedFirstLap && !rw?.lap2 && !rw?.lap3) {\n        bonus = 2500;\n        message = `${player.name} ï¼ˆé€†è¡Œè€…ï¼‰è·å¾—è¡¥å¿ ${bonus} å…ƒï¼`;\n        if (rw) rw.lap2 = true;\n      } else if (rw?.lap2) {\n        bonus = 3000;\n        message = `${player.name} ï¼ˆé€†è¡Œè€…ï¼‰è·å¾—é«˜é¢è¡¥å¿ ${bonus} å…ƒï¼`;\n        if (rw) {\n          rw.lap2 = false;\n          rw.lap3 = true;\n        }\n      } else if (rw?.lap3) {\n        bonus = 3000;\n        message = `${player.name} ï¼ˆé€†è¡Œè€…ï¼‰è·å¾—é«˜é¢è¡¥å¿ ${bonus} å…ƒï¼`;\n      }\n      break;\n    }\n\n    // 3. ä¿®ç‹—ï¼šå»ºç­‘æ´¥è´´\n    case 'role-6nd6bp': {\n      const propertyCount = player.properties.length;\n      const subsidy = propertyCount * 200;\n      bonus = 2000 + subsidy;\n      message = `${player.name} æ‹¥æœ‰ ${propertyCount} æ ‹åœ°äº§ï¼Œè·å¾—æ´¥è´´ ${subsidy} å…ƒï¼Œå…± ${bonus} å…ƒï¼`;\n      break;\n    }\n\n    // 4. æ²³è±šï¼šåŸºç¡€å¥–é‡‘ + è“„æ°”\n    case 'role-yce1tw': {\n      bonus = 2000;\n      const enhancedPufferStart = (gameProcess.__enhanced || {})[player.id] === \"role-yce1tw\";\n        player.pufferTollCount = (player.pufferTollCount || 0) + (enhancedPufferStart ? 3 : 1);\n      const progress = player.pufferTollCount;\n      const buffId = `puffer-toll-display-${player.id}`;\n      const buff = player.buffManager.getBuffs().find(b => b.id === buffId);\n      if (buff) {\n        player.buffManager.updateBuff(buffId, {\n          description: `æ¯ä»˜3æ¬¡è¿‡è·¯è´¹å“ˆæ°”å…å• Â· è¿›åº¦ ${Math.min(progress, 3)}/3`\n        });\n      }\n      if (progress >= 3) {\n        player.pufferTollCount = 0;\n        player.buffManager.addBuff({\n          id: `puffer-free-${player.id}-${Date.now()}`,\n          name: `æ²³è±šå“ˆæ°”`,\n          triggerTiming: `è¢«åŠ¨æ•ˆæœ`,\n          description: `ä¸‹ä¸€æ¬¡è¿‡è·¯è´¹å…é™¤`,\n          source: `è§’è‰²æŠ€èƒ½`,\n          triggerTimes: 1\n        });\n        message = `${player.name} ç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹è·å¾— ${bonus} å…ƒï¼Œè“„æ°”å·²æ»¡ï¼ä¸‹ä¸€æ¬¡è¿‡è·¯è´¹å°†å…å•ï¼`;\n      } else {\n        message = `${player.name} ç»è¿‡èµ·ç‚¹è·å¾— ${bonus} å…ƒï¼Œè“„æ°”è¿›åº¦ ${progress}/3`;\n      }\n      break;\n    }\n\n    // 5. è‚¡è‚¡å˜å˜ï¼šè‚¡å¸‚åˆ†çº¢\n    case 'role-4pb0n6': {\n      const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n      let totalValue = 0;\n      if (stockMarket) {\n        const holdings = stockMarket.getPlayerHoldingStock(player.id);\n        totalValue = holdings.reduce((sum, h) => sum + h.holding * h.stock.price, 0);\n      }\n      const dividend = Math.floor(totalValue * 0.05);\n      bonus = 2000 + dividend;\n      message = `${player.name} æŒä»“å¸‚å€¼ ${totalValue} å…ƒï¼Œåˆ†çº¢ ${dividend} å…ƒï¼Œå…± ${bonus} å…ƒï¼`;\n      break;\n    }\n\n    // 6. çŒªçŒªï¼šéª°å­ç‚¹æ•°åŠ æˆï¼ˆç›´æ¥æŠ•æ·ï¼‰\n    case 'role-2u1dfq': {\n      const diceResults = await player.rollDices();\n      const diceSum = diceResults.reduce((sum, d) => sum + d.result, 0);\n      bonus = diceSum * 300;\n      message = `${player.name} çš„éª°å­ç‚¹æ•°ä¸º ${diceSum}ï¼Œè·å¾—å¥–é‡‘ ${bonus} å…ƒï¼`;\n      break;\n    }\n  }\n\n  // åº”ç”¨é€šèƒ€å€ç‡\n  const inflationRate = gameProcess.inflationRate ?? 1.0;\n  const finalBonus = Math.round(bonus * inflationRate);\n  if (inflationRate !== 1.0) {\n    message = message.replace(`${bonus} å…ƒ`, `${finalBonus} å…ƒï¼ˆé€šèƒ€Ã—${inflationRate.toFixed(2)}ï¼‰`);\n  }\n\n  // å‘æ”¾å¥–é‡‘\n  await player.gain(finalBonus);\n  gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast('success', message);\n});"},{"id":"event-dudtrj","name":"æœºä¼šå¡å•†åº—","description":"ç»è¿‡å•†åº—å¯ä»¥è´­ä¹°æœºä¼šå¡","type":"PassedEvent","iconId":"image-fdeqn8","properties":[],"effectCode":"(async (player: IPlayer, gameProcess: IGameProcess) => {\r\n    gameProcess.setCurrentEventName(`${player.name} æ­£åœ¨é€‰è´­æœºä¼šå¡`);\r\n    const chanceCardNum = 3;\r\n    const chancePriceRange = [200, 2000]\r\n    const chanceCardItems = [...gameProcess.chanceCardInfos.values()]\r\n        .sort(() => 0.5 - Math.random())\r\n        .slice(0, chanceCardNum)\r\n        .map(c => {\r\n            const money = randomMoney(chancePriceRange[0], chancePriceRange[1]);\r\n            return {\r\n                id: c.id,\r\n                display: createChanceCardUISchema(c, `${money}ï¿¥`),\r\n                info: c,\r\n                money,\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    const res = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\r\n        title: \"æœºä¼šå¡å•†åº—\",\r\n        content: `è´­ä¹°æœºä¼šå¡`,\r\n        itemList: chanceCardItems,\r\n        cancelText: \"ä¸ä¹°\"\r\n    })\r\n\r\n    if (res.selected.length > 0) {\r\n        for (const selectedId of res.selected) {\r\n            const selectedItem = chanceCardItems.find(c => c.id === selectedId);\r\n            if (player.money < selectedItem.money) {\r\n                gameProcess.messageNotify([player.id], { type: \"error\", content: `ä½ çš„é’±ä¸å¤Ÿä¹° ${selectedItem.info.name}` });\r\n                continue;\r\n            }\r\n            await player.cost(selectedItem.money, MoneyTag.SYSTEM);\r\n            await player.gainCard(gameProcess.createNewChanceCard(selectedId));\r\n            gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"success\", `${player.name} è´­ä¹°äº†æœºä¼šå¡ ${selectedItem.info.name}`)\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function createChanceCardUISchema(chanceCard: ChanceCardInfo, money: string): UISchema {\r\n        const { name, description, color } = chanceCard;\r\n        return {\r\n            id: \"chance-card\",\r\n            type: \"div\",\r\n            variable: { name, description, color, money },\r\n            children: [\r\n                $ui__chance_card_info,\r\n                {\r\n                    id: \"money-container\",\r\n                    type: \"div\",\r\n                    style: {\r\n                        width: \"max-content\",\r\n                        margin: 'auto',\r\n                        marginTop: \".6em\",\r\n                        padding: \".2em 1em\",\r\n                        backgroundColor: \"#ffffff\",\r\n                        color: \"var(--fp-color-primary)\",\r\n                        border: \".2em solid\",\r\n                        borderRadius: \".6em\",\r\n                    },\r\n                    children: [{\r\n                        id: 'money-text',\r\n                        type: \"text\",\r\n                        textBinding: 'money',\r\n                    }]\r\n                }\r\n            ],\r\n        };\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    function randomMoney(min: number, max: number): number {\r\n        const raw = Math.random() * (max - min) + min;\r\n        return Math.floor(raw / 100) * 100;\r\n    }\r\n});"},{"id":"event-f8rdwz","name":"é­”æ³•å±‹","description":"é€‰æ‹©ä¸€ä¸ªäº‹ä»¶ï¼Œå¯¹æ»¡è¶³éšæœºæ¡ä»¶çš„äººç”Ÿæ•ˆ","type":"ArrivedEvent","iconId":"image-l2exzl","properties":[],"effectCode":"(async (player: IPlayer, gameProcess: IGameProcess) => {\n    interface TargetFilter {\n        name: string,\n        filter: (players: IPlayer[]) => IPlayer[];\n    }\n    interface RandomEvent {\n        id: string,\n        name: string,\n        desc: string,\n        fn: (targets: IPlayer[]) => Promise<void>\n    }\n\n    const targetFilter: TargetFilter[] = [\n        {\n            name: `ç°é‡‘å¤§äº5000å—é’±çš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                return players.filter((p => p.money > 5000));\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `ç°é‡‘å°äº5000å—é’±çš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                return players.filter((p => p.money < 5000));\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `æœºä¼šå¡æ•°é‡æœ€å¤šçš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                const playerCardCounts = players.map(p => ({\n                    player: p,\n                    count: p.chanceCards.length\n                }));\n                const maxCount = Math.max(...playerCardCounts.map(item => item.count));\n                if (maxCount === 0) {\n                    return [];\n                }\n                return playerCardCounts\n                    .filter(item => item.count === maxCount)\n                    .map(item => item.player);\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `æœºä¼šå¡æ•°é‡æœ€å°‘çš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                const playerCardCounts = players.map(p => ({\n                    player: p,\n                    count: p.chanceCards.length\n                }));\n                const minCount = Math.min(...playerCardCounts.map(item => item.count));\n                if (minCount === 0) {\n                    return [];\n                }\n                return playerCardCounts\n                    .filter(item => item.count === minCount)\n                    .map(item => item.player);\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `æˆ¿äº§æ•°é‡æœ€å¤šçš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                const playerPropertiesCounts = players.map(p => ({\n                    player: p,\n                    count: p.properties.length\n                }));\n                const maxCount = Math.max(...playerPropertiesCounts.map(item => item.count));\n                if (maxCount === 0) {\n                    return [];\n                }\n                return playerPropertiesCounts\n                    .filter(item => item.count === maxCount)\n                    .map(item => item.player);\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `æˆ¿äº§æ•°é‡æœ€å°‘çš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                const playerPropertiesCounts = players.map(p => ({\n                    player: p,\n                    count: p.properties.length\n                }));\n                const minCount = Math.min(...playerPropertiesCounts.map(item => item.count));\n                if (minCount === 0) {\n                    return [];\n                }\n                return playerPropertiesCounts\n                    .filter(item => item.count === minCount)\n                    .map(item => item.player);\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `éšæœºä¸€ä½ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                return [players[Math.floor(Math.random() * players.length)]];\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `è‚¡ç¥¨æ€»å¸‚å€¼æœ€é«˜çš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n                const playerValues = players.map(p => {\n                    const holdings = stockMarket.getPlayerHoldingStock(p.id);\n                    const totalValue = holdings.reduce((sum, r) => sum + r.holding * r.stock.price, 0);\n                    return { player: p, value: totalValue };\n                });\n                const maxValue = Math.max(...playerValues.map(item => item.value));\n                if (maxValue === 0) return [];\n                return playerValues.filter(item => item.value === maxValue).map(item => item.player);\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            name: `æ²¡æœ‰æŒæœ‰ä»»ä½•è‚¡ç¥¨çš„ç©å®¶`, filter: (players) => {\n                const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n                return players.filter(p => {\n                    const holdings = stockMarket.getPlayerHoldingStock(p.id);\n                    return holdings.every(r => r.holding <= 0);\n                });\n            }\n        }\n    ];\n\n    const events: RandomEvent[] = [\n        {\n            id: \"gain-money\", name: \"è·å¾—2000å—é’±\", desc: \"ç©å®¶è·å¾—2000å—é’±\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                for (const player of players) {\n                    await player.gain(2000);\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"cost-money\", name: \"å¤±å»2000å—é’±\", desc: \"ç©å®¶å¤±å»2000å—é’±\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                for (const player of players) {\n                    await player.cost(2000);\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"build-up\", name: \"éšæœºæå‡ä¸€æ ‹å»ºç­‘çš„ç­‰çº§\", desc: \"ç©å®¶éšæœºæå‡ä¸€æ ‹å»ºç­‘çš„ç­‰çº§\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                for (const player of players) {\n                    const properties = player.properties.filter((p) => p.level < p.maxLevel);\n                    if (properties.length === 0) {\n                        continue;\n                    }\n                    const randomProperty = properties[Math.floor(Math.random() * properties.length)];\n                    await randomProperty.levelUp();\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"build-down\", name: \"éšæœºé™ä½ä¸€æ ‹å»ºç­‘çš„ç­‰çº§\", desc: \"ç©å®¶éšæœºé™ä½ä¸€æ ‹å»ºç­‘çš„ç­‰çº§\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                for (const player of players) {\n                    const properties = player.properties.filter((p) => p.level > 0);\n                    if (properties.length === 0) {\n                        continue;\n                    }\n                    const randomProperty = properties[Math.floor(Math.random() * properties.length)];\n                    await randomProperty.levelDown();\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"gain-card\", name: \"éšæœºè·å¾—ä¸€å¼ æœºä¼šå¡\", desc: \"ç©å®¶éšæœºè·å¾—ä¸€å¼ æœºä¼šå¡\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                const cardSourceIdList = Array.from(gameProcess.chanceCardInfos.keys());\n                for (const player of players) {\n                    const newCard = gameProcess.createNewChanceCard(cardSourceIdList[Math.floor(Math.random() * cardSourceIdList.length)]);\n                    await player.gainCard(newCard);\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"stock-surge\", name: \"è‚¡ç¥¨æš´æ¶¨\", desc: \"éšæœºä¸€åªè‚¡ç¥¨å¤§å¹…ä¸Šæ¶¨ï¼ŒæŒæœ‰äººèººèµš\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n                const stocks = stockMarket.data.stocks;\n                if (stocks.length === 0) return;\n                const randomStock = stocks[Math.floor(Math.random() * stocks.length)];\n                stockMarket.triggerEvent(randomStock.id, 'RANDOM', 3);\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"stock-crash\", name: \"è‚¡å¸‚å´©ç›˜\", desc: \"å¸‚åœºè½¬å…¥ç†Šå¸‚ï¼Œæ‰€æœ‰è‚¡ç¥¨ä¸‹è·Œ\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n                stockMarket.setMarketTrend(-0.8);\n                for (const stock of stockMarket.data.stocks) {\n                    stockMarket.triggerEvent(stock.id, 'RANDOM', 3);\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"force-buy\", name: \"å¼ºåˆ¶ä¹°å…¥\", desc: \"å¼ºåˆ¶ä¹°å…¥ä¸€åªéšæœºè‚¡ç¥¨\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n                const stocks = stockMarket.data.stocks;\n                if (stocks.length === 0) return;\n                const randomStock = stocks[Math.floor(Math.random() * stocks.length)];\n                for (const p of players) {\n                    const budget = Math.floor(p.money / 5);\n                    const maxAmount = Math.floor(budget / (randomStock.price * (1 + stockMarket.getTaxRate(true))));\n                    if (maxAmount <= 0) continue;\n                    const amount = Math.min(maxAmount, 100);\n                    const canTradeRes = stockMarket.canTrade(p.id, randomStock.id, amount, true);\n                    if (!canTradeRes.ok) continue;\n                    const receipt = stockMarket.commitBuy(p.id, randomStock.id, amount);\n                    if (receipt) {\n                        await p.cost(receipt.totalCost);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            id: \"force-sell\", name: \"å¼ºåˆ¶å¹³ä»“\", desc: \"éšæœºå–æ‰ä¸€åŠæŒä»“\",\n            fn: async (players) => {\n                const stockMarket = gameProcess.stockMarket;\n                for (const p of players) {\n                    const holdings = stockMarket.getPlayerHoldingStock(p.id).filter(r => r.holding > 0);\n                    if (holdings.length === 0) continue;\n                    const randomHolding = holdings[Math.floor(Math.random() * holdings.length)];\n                    const sellAmount = Math.floor(randomHolding.holding / 2);\n                    if (sellAmount <= 0) continue;\n                    const canTradeRes = stockMarket.canTrade(p.id, randomHolding.stock.id, sellAmount, false);\n                    if (!canTradeRes.ok) continue;\n                    const receipt = stockMarket.commitSell(p.id, randomHolding.stock.id, sellAmount);\n                    if (receipt) {\n                        await p.gain(receipt.totalCost);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    ];\n    const res = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\n        title: \"é­”æ³•å±‹\",\n        content: \"é€‰æ‹©ä¸€ä¸ªæ•ˆæœï¼Œä¼šä½œç”¨äºéšæœºçš„ç©å®¶\",\n        cancelText: \"ä¸é€‰\",\n        itemList: events.map(e => ({\n            id: e.id,\n            display: e.desc\n        }))\n    });\n\n    if (res.selected && res.selected.length > 0) {\n        const selectedEvent = events.find((e => e.id === res.selected[0])) || events[0];\n        const randowTargetRange = targetFilter[Math.floor(Math.random() * targetFilter.length)]\n        const randomTargets = randowTargetRange.filter(Array.from(gameProcess.players.values()));\n\n        await gameProcess.showMessageCard(gameProcess.getAllPlayersId(), {\n            title: `${player.name} é­”æ³•å±‹é€‰æ‹©ç»“æœ`,\n            content: {\n                \"id\": \"event-info-container\",\n                \"type\": \"div\",\n                \"style\": {\n                    \"display\": \"flex\",\n                    \"flexDirection\": \"column\",\n                    \"gap\": \"0.5rem\",\n                    \"maxWidth\": \"30rem\"\n                },\n                \"children\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": \"event-title-row\",\n                        \"type\": \"div\",\n                        \"style\": {\n                            \"display\": \"flex\",\n                            \"flexDirection\": \"row\",\n                            \"alignItems\": \"baseline\",\n                            \"gap\": \"0.25rem\"\n                        },\n                        \"children\": [\n                            {\n                                \"id\": \"event-name\",\n                                \"type\": \"text\",\n                                \"content\": selectedEvent.name,\n                                \"style\": {\n                                    \"fontSize\": \"1.125rem\",\n                                    \"fontWeight\": \"bold\",\n                                    \"color\": \"var(--color-primary)\"\n                                }\n                            },\n                            {\n                                \"id\": \"event-range\",\n                                \"type\": \"text\",\n                                \"content\": `èŒƒå›´: ${randowTargetRange.name}`,\n                                \"style\": {\n                                    \"fontSize\": \"1.125rem\",\n                                    \"fontWeight\": \"bold\",\n                                    \"color\": \"#333333\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                        ]\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"id\": \"player-label\",\n                        \"type\": \"text\",\n                        \"content\": \"æ¶‰åŠçš„ç©å®¶:\",\n                        \"style\": {\n                            \"fontSize\": \"0.875rem\",\n                            \"color\": \"#666666\",\n                            \"fontWeight\": \"600\"\n                        }\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"id\": \"player-list\",\n                        \"type\": \"text\",\n                        \"content\": randomTargets.length > 0 ? randomTargets.map(p => p.name).join('ã€') : 'æ— ',\n                        \"style\": {\n                            \"fontSize\": \"1rem\",\n                            \"color\": \"#495057\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            duration: 3500\n        })\n\n        if (randomTargets.length > 0) {\n            await selectedEvent.fn(randomTargets);\n        } else {\n            gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"warning\", \"æ²¡æœ‰ç¬¦åˆæ¡ä»¶çš„ç©å®¶!\");\n        }\n    }\n\n\n});\n"},{"id":"event-g66ur7","name":"å½©ç¥¨ç«™","description":"å¯è´­ä¹°å½©ç¥¨ã€åˆ®åˆ®ä¹ï¼Œå…è´¹å‚ä¸æ‹¼æ‰‹æ°”çº¢åŒ…","type":"PassedEvent","iconId":"image-wwt70o","properties":[],"effectCode":"(async (player, gameProcess) => {\n  const lotteryManager = gameProcess.lotteryManager;\n  // æœ¬æ¬¡è¿›ç«™å·²è´­æ ‡å¿—ï¼šä¹°è¿‡çš„é¡¹ä»ä¸»èœå•ç§»é™¤ï¼ˆä¸èƒ½å†æ¬¡ç‚¹å‡»ï¼‰\n  const bought = { classic: false, scratch: false, redpacket: false };\n  // ä¸»èœå•å¾ªç¯ï¼šç¦»å¼€æ‰é€€å‡ºï¼›ä¹°å®Œ/è¿”å›éƒ½å›åˆ°æœ¬èœå•\n  for (;;) {\n    const items = [];\n    if (!bought.classic) items.push({ id: \"classic\", display: \"ğŸŸ å½©ç¥¨ï¼ˆ\" + lotteryManager.price + \"å…ƒ/å¼ ï¼Œæ¯äººæ¯æ¬¡æœ€å¤šä¹°3å¼ ï¼Œå‘¨ä¸€å¼€å¥–ï¼‰\" });\n    if (!bought.scratch) items.push({ id: \"scratch\", display: \"ğŸ« åˆ®åˆ®ä¹ï¼ˆ500 å…ƒ/å¼ ï¼Œå³åˆ®å³ä¸­ï¼‰\" });\n    // REDPACKET_SYSï¼šä¸¤æ¡£éƒ½å‚ä¸çš„ç©å®¶ä¸å†æ˜¾ç¤ºçº¢åŒ…æŒ‰é’®\n    const rpState = gameProcess.__redpacket || { joined300: [], joined500: [] };\n    if (!bought.redpacket && (!rpState.joined300.includes(player.id) || !rpState.joined500.includes(player.id))) items.push({ id: \"redpacket\", display: \"ğŸ§§ æ‹¼æ‰‹æ°”çº¢åŒ…ï¼ˆ1000å…ƒæ¡£/2500å…ƒæ¡£ï¼‰\" });\n    if (items.length === 0) { return; }\n    const modeRes = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\n      title: \"å½©ç¥¨ç«™\",\n      content: \"æƒ³ä¹°å“ªç§ï¼Ÿ\",\n      cancelText: \"ç¦»å¼€\",\n      itemList: items,\n    });\n    if (!modeRes.selected || modeRes.selected.length !== 1) {\n      gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"info\", player.name + \" è·¯è¿‡å½©ç¥¨ç«™ï¼Œæ²¡æœ‰åœç•™ã€‚\");\n      return;\n    }\n    if (modeRes.selected[0] === \"classic\") {\n      // ä½™é¢é¢„æ£€ï¼šä¸è¶³ä¸€å¼ ç¥¨ä»· â†’ å¹¿æ’­åå›ä¸»èœå•\n      if (player.money < lotteryManager.price) {\n        gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"info\", player.name + \" èº«ä¸Šçš„é’±ä¸è¶³ä»¥ä¹°ä¸€å¼ å½©ç¥¨ã€‚\");\n      } else {\n      // å•æ¬¡è´­ä¹°ï¼šè¿”å›ï¼ˆä¸é€‰ï¼‰æˆ–ä¹°å®Œéƒ½å›ä¸»èœå•\n      // å¯é€‰å¼ æ•°æŒ‰ä½™é¢åŠ¨æ€åŒ–ï¼šå¤Ÿ 1 å¼ é€‰ 1ã€å¤Ÿ 2 å¼ é€‰ 2ã€å¤Ÿ 3 å¼ é€‰ 3\n      const maxTickets = player.money >= lotteryManager.price * 3 ? 3 : player.money >= lotteryManager.price * 2 ? 2 : 1;\n      const res = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\n        title: \"è´­ä¹°å½©ç¥¨\",\n        content: \"é€‰æ‹©å¿ƒæ„çš„å·ç è´­ä¹°å½©ç¥¨ï¼ˆæ¯äººæ¯æ¬¡æœ€å¤š3å¼ ï¼Œæ¯å¼ \" + lotteryManager.price + \"å…ƒï¼‰ï¼Œæ¯å‘¨ä¸€å¼€å¥–\\nå½“å‰å¥–æ± : \" + lotteryManager.currentJackpot + \"å…ƒï¼ˆæ¯è¿‡ä¸€å‘¨å¥–æ± å¢åŠ 1000å…ƒï¼‰\",\n        cancelText: \"è¿”å›\",\n        multiple: maxTickets,\n        column: 5,\n        itemList: lotteryManager.stock.map((l) => ({ id: String(l), display: String(l) })),\n      });\n      if (res.selected && res.selected.length > 0) {\n        await gameProcess.handleBuyLottery(player, res.selected.map((x) => Number(x)));\n        // è´­ä¹°åç«‹å³ç»“ç®—ï¼šå¼ºåˆ¶åŒæ­¥ä½™é¢\n        gameProcess.gameDataBroadcast();\n        bought.classic = true;\n      }\n      }\n    } else if (modeRes.selected[0] === \"redpacket\") {\n      // ä½™é¢é¢„æ£€ï¼šä¸è¶³æœ€ä½æ¡£ï¼ˆ300ï¼‰â†’ å¹¿æ’­åå›ä¸»èœå•ï¼ˆä¸å¼¹çº¢åŒ…ç¡®è®¤æ¡†ï¼‰\n       else {\n      // REDPACKET_SYSï¼šæ¡£ä½é€‰æ‹©ï¼ˆAï¼‰â†’ ç¡®è®¤å‚ä¸ï¼ˆBï¼‰ï¼›å·²å‚ä¸æ¡£å†ç¡®è®¤ = å¹¿æ’­+å›A\n      for (;;) {\n        const rpNow = gameProcess.__redpacket || { joined300: [], joined500: [] };\n        const mkItem = (id, label, joined) => joined\n          ? { id: id, display: { id: \"rpui-\" + id, type: \"span\", style: { color: \"#999999\" }, children: [{ type: \"text\", content: label + \"ï¼ˆå·²å‚ä¸ï¼‰\" }] } }\n          : { id: id, display: label };\n        const items = [\n          mkItem(\"tier300\", \"1000 å…ƒæ¡£ï¼ˆæ€»å¥–æ±  ï¿¥1000ï¼Œæ¯äºº ï¿¥150ï½ï¿¥500ï¼‰\", rpNow.joined300.includes(player.id)),\n          mkItem(\"tier500\", \"2500 å…ƒæ¡£ï¼ˆæ€»å¥–æ±  ï¿¥2500ï¼Œæ¯äºº ï¿¥300ï½ï¿¥1200ï¼‰\", rpNow.joined500.includes(player.id)),\n        ];\n        const tierRes = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\n          title: \"ğŸ§§ æ‹¼æ‰‹æ°”çº¢åŒ…\",\n          content: \"é€‰æ‹©å‚ä¸æ¡£ä½ï¼Œæ¯å‘¨å››ç»“ç®—ï¼Œæ¯äººæ¯å‘¨æ¯æ¡£é™å‚ä¸ä¸€æ¬¡\",\n          cancelText: \"è¿”å›\",\n          multiple: 1,\n          column: 1,\n          itemList: items,\n        });\n        if (!tierRes.selected || tierRes.selected.length !== 1) break;\n        const tier = tierRes.selected[0] === \"tier300\"\n          ? { key: \"joined300\", total: 1000, min: 150, max: 500, label: \"1000 å…ƒæ¡£\" }\n          : { key: \"joined500\", total: 2500, min: 300, max: 1200, label: \"2500 å…ƒæ¡£\" };\n        const already = rpNow[tier.key].includes(player.id);\n        if (already) {\n          // å·²å‚ä¸æ¡£ï¼šæé†’æ¡†ï¼ˆç‚¹ç¡®è®¤/è¿”å›å‡å›çº¢åŒ…ç¡®è®¤æ¡†ï¼‰\n          await gameProcess.showConfirmDialog(player.id, {\n            title: \"å·²å‚ä¸æé†’\",\n            content: \"ä½ æœ¬å‘¨å·²å‚ä¸è¯¥æ¡£çš„æ‹¼æ‰‹æ°”çº¢åŒ…ï¼Œå‘¨å››ç»“ç®—åæ‰èƒ½å†æ¬¡å‚ä¸ã€‚\",\n            confirmText: \"çŸ¥é“äº†\",\n            cancelText: \"è¿”å›\",\n            closable: true,\n          });\n          gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"info\", player.name + \" æœ¬å‘¨å·²å‚ä¸è¯¥æ¡£çš„æ‹¼æ‰‹æ°”çº¢åŒ…ã€‚\");\n          continue;\n        }\n        // ä½™é¢é¢„æ£€ï¼šä¸è¶³è¯¥æ¡£ â†’ å¹¿æ’­åå›çº¢åŒ…ç¡®è®¤æ¡†ï¼ˆä¸å¼¹ç¡®è®¤å‚ä¸æ¡†ï¼‰\n        \n        const confRes = await gameProcess.showConfirmDialog(player.id, {\n          title: \"ç¡®è®¤å‚ä¸ \" + tier.label,\n          content: tier.label + \"ï¼šæ€»å¥–æ±  ï¿¥\" + tier.total + \"ï¼ŒæŒ‰å‚ä¸äººæ•°éšæœºåˆ†é…ï¼Œæ¯äºº ï¿¥\" + tier.min + \"ï½ï¿¥\" + tier.max + \"ã€‚å…è´¹å‚ä¸ï¼Œåé¢æœ‰é™ã€‚\",\n          confirmText: \"ç¡®è®¤å‚ä¸\",\n          cancelText: \"è¿”å›\",\n          closable: true,\n        });\n        if (!confRes.confirm) break;\n        if (!gameProcess.__redpacket) gameProcess.__redpacket = { joined300: [], joined500: [] };\n        gameProcess.__redpacket[tier.key].push(player.id);\n        gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"success\", player.name + \" å‚ä¸äº† \" + tier.label + \" æ‹¼æ‰‹æ°”çº¢åŒ…ï¼\");\n        gameProcess.gameDataBroadcast();\n        // å‚ä¸ä»»ä¸€æ¡£åï¼šæœ¬æ¬¡è¿›ç«™å†…çº¢åŒ…æŒ‰é’®ç§»é™¤ï¼ˆä¸‹æ¬¡è§¦å‘å½©ç¥¨ç«™äº‹ä»¶å†æ¢å¤ï¼‰\n        bought.redpacket = true;\n        break;\n      }\n      }\n    } else {\n      // ä½™é¢é¢„æ£€ï¼šä¸è¶³ä¸€å¼  â†’ å¹¿æ’­åå›ä¸»èœå•ï¼ˆä¸å¼¹é€‰æ ¼æ¡†ï¼‰\n      if (player.money < 500) {\n        gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"info\", player.name + \" èº«ä¸Šçš„é’±ä¸å¤Ÿåˆ®ä¸€å¼ åˆ®åˆ®ä¹ã€‚\");\n      } else {\n      // å•æ¬¡åˆ®åˆ®ä¹ï¼šè¿”å›ï¼ˆä¸é€‰ï¼‰æˆ–åˆ®å®Œéƒ½å›ä¸»èœå•\n      // å¥–é‡‘é¢åº¦ï¼šæ¯å‘¨ä¸€åœ¨åŸå…ˆåŸºç¡€ä¸Šé€’å¢ï¼ˆé•+250 / å®çŸ³+500 / æ˜Ÿæ˜Ÿ+750ï¼‰\n      const sp = gameProcess.__scratchPrize || (gameProcess.__scratchPrize = { pickaxe: 750, gem: 1000, star: 1750 });\n      const bag = [\"ğŸ’£\", \"ğŸ’£\", \"ğŸ’£\", \"â›\", \"â›\", \"â›\", \"ğŸ’\", \"ğŸ’\", \"â­\"];\n      for (let i = bag.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n        const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n        const t = bag[i]; bag[i] = bag[j]; bag[j] = t;\n      }\n      const pickRes = await gameProcess.showItemSelectDialog(player.id, {\n        title: \"åˆ®åˆ®ä¹ - ç›²é€‰ä¸€æ ¼åˆ®å¼€ï¼ˆ500 å…ƒï¼‰\",\n        content: \"â› é• Ã—3ï¼ˆï¿¥\" + sp.pickaxe + \"ï¼‰ã€€ğŸ’ å®çŸ³ Ã—2ï¼ˆï¿¥\" + sp.gem + \"ï¼‰ã€€â­ æ˜Ÿæ˜Ÿ Ã—1ï¼ˆï¿¥\" + sp.star + \"ï¼‰ã€€ğŸ’£ ç‚¸å¼¹Ã—3ï¼ˆï¿¥0ï¼‰\",\n        cancelText: \"è¿”å›\",\n        column: 3,\n        itemList: bag.map((_, i) => ({ id: String(i), display: \"â“\" })),\n      });\n      if (pickRes.selected && pickRes.selected.length === 1) {\n        const costRes = await player.cost(500, MoneyTag.PLAYER);\n        if (!costRes || costRes.actualCost < 500) {\n          gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"info\", player.name + \" èº«ä¸Šçš„é’±ä¸å¤Ÿåˆ®ä¸€å¼ åˆ®åˆ®ä¹ã€‚\");\n        } else {\n        const pickIdx = Number(pickRes.selected[0]);\n        const face = bag[pickIdx];\n        const prizeMap = { \"ğŸ’£\": 0, \"â›\": sp.pickaxe, \"ğŸ’\": sp.gem, \"â­\": sp.star };\n        const prize = prizeMap[face] || 0;\n        if (prize > 0) await player.gain(prize, \"system\");\n        const rows = [];\n        for (let r = 0; r < 3; r++) {\n          let line = \"\";\n          for (let c = 0; c < 3; c++) {\n            const idx = r * 3 + c;\n            // å…¨è§’ç©ºæ ¼åŒ…ä½æœªé€‰æ ¼ï¼Œä¸ã€Xã€‘ï¼ˆ3 å…¨è§’å®½ï¼‰å¯¹é½\n            line += idx === pickIdx ? \"ã€\" + bag[idx] + \"ã€‘\" : \"ã€€\" + bag[idx] + \"ã€€\";\n          }\n          // text æ¸²æŸ“ä¸º spanï¼ˆinlineï¼‰ä¼šæŒ¤æˆä¸€è¡Œâ€”â€”æ¯è¡Œç”¨ divï¼ˆblockï¼‰åŒ…è£¹æ‰èƒ½ä¸‰è¡Œæ˜¾ç¤º\n          rows.push({ type: \"div\", style: { textAlign: \"center\", fontSize: \"1.5rem\", lineHeight: 1.5 }, children: [{ type: \"text\", content: line }] });\n        }\n        const resultText = prize > 0 ? \"ğŸ‰ åˆ®ä¸­äº†ã€\" + face + \"ã€‘ï¼å¥–é‡‘ ï¿¥\" + prize + \" å·²å…¥è´¦ï¼\" : \"ğŸ’¨ åˆ®å‡ºäº†ç‚¸å¼¹â€¦â€¦ä¸‹å¼ ä¸€å®šä¸­ï¼\";\n        rows.push({ type: \"text\", content: \"â€”â€”â€”\", style: { textAlign: \"center\", color: \"#bdc3c7\" } });\n        rows.push({ type: \"text\", content: resultText, style: { textAlign: \"center\", fontWeight: \"bold\", color: prize > 0 ? \"#e67e22\" : \"#95a5a6\" } });\n        await gameProcess.showMessageCard([player.id], {\n          title: \"åˆ®åˆ®ä¹å¼€å¥–\",\n          content: { type: \"div\", style: { padding: \"0.5rem\" }, children: rows },\n          duration: 3333,\n        });\n        gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(prize > 0 ? \"success\" : \"info\", player.name + \" åˆ®åˆ®ä¹åˆ®å‡ºäº†ã€\" + face + \"ã€‘\" + (prize > 0 ? \"ï¼Œå¥–é‡‘ ï¿¥\" + prize + \"ï¼\" : \"â€¦â€¦\"));\n        gameProcess.gameDataBroadcast();\n        bought.scratch = true;\n        }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n})"},{"id":"event-mod-airport","type":"ArrivedEvent","name":"æœºåœºå¿«çº¿","description":"èŠ±è´¹600å…ƒæ­ä¹˜é£æœºï¼Œéšæœºå‘å‰é£è·ƒ8~10æ ¼ã€‚","iconId":"image-mod-airport","effectCode":"(async (player, gameProcess) => {\n  const res = await gameProcess.showConfirmDialog(player.id, {\n    title: \"é¸½é¸½èˆªç©º Â· æœºåœºå¿«çº¿\",\n    content: \"ç™»æœºå£å¹¿æ’­ï¼šæœ¬æ¬¡èˆªç­å³å°†èµ·é£ã€‚\\næœºç¥¨ <color:primary>ï¿¥600</color>ï¼Œéšæœºå‘å‰é£è·ƒ 10~12 æ ¼ï¼Œä¸ç»è¿‡æ²¿é€”ä»»ä½•åœ°ç‚¹ï¼Œè½ç‚¹æ­£å¸¸ç»“ç®—ï¼ˆå¯ä¹°åœ°çš®ã€è§¦å‘äº‹ä»¶ï¼‰ã€‚\",\n    confirmText: \"èµ·é£ï¼\",\n    cancelText: \"æ™•æœºï¼Œç®—äº†\",\n  });\n  if (!res.confirm) { gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"info\", player.name + \" æ™•æœºï¼Œæ²¡æœ‰ç™»æœºã€‚\"); return; }\n  const paid = await player.cost(600, \"system\");\n  if (paid.actualCost < 600) {\n    await gameProcess.showMessageCard([player.id], { title: \"é¸½é¸½èˆªç©º\", content: \"<color:#e74c3c>ä½™é¢ä¸è¶³ï¼Œè¢«è¯·ä¸‹é£æœºã€‚</color>\" });\n    return;\n  }\n  const nextOf = new Map(), prevOf = new Map();\n  for (const p of gameProcess.mapData.mapPaths) {\n    if (/^mi-dz-b/.test(p.fromMapItemId) || /^mi-dz-b/.test(p.toMapItemId)) continue; // é£è·ƒåªåœ¨å¤–ç¯ï¼šè·³è¿‡æ¡¥è·¯å¾„\n    if (!nextOf.has(p.fromMapItemId)) nextOf.set(p.fromMapItemId, p.toMapItemId);\n    if (!prevOf.has(p.toMapItemId)) prevOf.set(p.toMapItemId, p.fromMapItemId);\n  }\n  // é€†è¡Œè€…ï¼ˆçè™¾ï¼‰æœè‡ªå·±çš„è¡Œè¿›æ–¹å‘é£ï¼šæ²¿è·¯å¾„åå‘å–å‰é©±\n  const isReverse = !!gameProcess.reverseWalkers?.[player.id];\n  const stepOf = isReverse ? prevOf : nextOf;\n  let cur = player.positionMapItemId;\n  const steps = 8 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 3);\n  for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) cur = stepOf.get(cur) || cur;\n  await player.tpToMapItem(cur);\n  gameProcess.msgNotifyBroadcast(\"info\", player.name + \" æ­ä¹˜é¸½é¸½èˆªç©º\" + (isReverse ? \"åå‘\" : \"\") + \"ç›´é£ \" + steps + \" æ ¼ï¼\");\n  await gameProcess.handleArriveEvent(player); // è½ç‚¹æ­£å¸¸ç»“ç®